SQL> --5]WRITE A QUERY TO DISPLAY EMPLOYEE NAME, JOB, SALARY OF THE EMPLOYEES WHO ARE WORKING AS SALESMAN ,MANAGER AND RESULT SHOULD BE IN ASENDING ORDER BASED ON SALARY COLUMN ?
SQL> 
SQL> SELECT ENAME, JOB, SAL
  2  FROM EMP
  3  WHERE JOB IN ('SALESMAN' , 'MANAGER')
  4  ORDER BY SAL ASC;

